  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki discovered the joys of being bowled over, tramped on and squashed every few minutes. He became an accepted member of the gang, an unlikely, silky little object among the shaggy crew, fighting like a tiger for his share at __________ and hunting rats in the old hen-house at night.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$mealtimes$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Mrs Pumphrey started to bring round fresh eggs, two dozen at a time, to build up Tricki’s strength. For a happy period my partners and I had two ________ each for breakfast, but when the bottles of wine began to arrive, the real possibilities of the situation began to dawn on the household.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$eggs$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$_______ from the background, Mrs Pumphrey hovered anxiously ringing a dozen times a day for the latest bulletins. I dodged the questions about whether his cushions were being turned regularly or his correct coat worn according to the weather; but I was able to tell her that the little fellow was out of danger and convalescing rapidly.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$Later$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s doggy ________ is a triumph of surgery, from what Mrs Pumphrey thinks. At the surgery, the household dogs surged round me. Tricki looked down at the noisy pack with dull eyes and, when put down, laid motionless on the carpet.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$Recovery$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I was able to tell her that the little fellow was out of danger and convalescing rapidly. The word ‘convalescing’ seemed to do something to Mrs Pumphrey. She started to bring round fresh eggs, two dozen at a time, to __________ up Tricki’s strength.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$build$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
