  ('af270b30-701e-49a4-bf9f-069332a6a6cc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$A wealthy man with an overweight dog consults a surgeon about his pampered pet. The story explores whether the consultation is necessary or if proper care and nutrition would have resolved the issue.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f02a8c89-9845-4705-a4e2-59a0284a2b01', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Mrs Pumphrey, a wealthy woman with an overweight dog, consults a surgeon about her pampered pet's condition. The story explores whether the consultation is necessary or if proper care and nutrition would have resolved the issue.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('329654b3-bbb4-4d0e-af0c-90bbe71dc77d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Mrs Pumphrey, Tricki's owner, tries to manage his health by giving him treats like chocolate and cream cakes. When these methods fail, she reluctantly agrees to cut down on his food intake but still feeds him some occasional sweets.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('75c15ab2-0327-4121-aef2-f8d919ba464d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s recovery is described as a triumph of surgery, and Mrs Pumphrey actively participates by bringing fresh eggs to support him. Despite Tricki having no medicinal treatment other than running with the dogs, he quickly gains acceptance into their group. His behavior changes from ignoring others to participating in games and hunts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3222df59-65d5-464f-a825-abc01d59b4c1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s demeanor changes from disinterested in the other dogs, who ignore him, to engaging and active. He starts showing interest in his surroundings after two days of being left alone. His behavior is described as both uninteresting initially and then as one that becomes an important part of Tricki's life.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('052b1e5d-03ad-47bd-9ee6-185c4f6f547e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki becomes an active participant in activities such as joining in their friendly scrimmages, running about with them, and hunting rats. He is described as fighting like a tiger for his share at mealtime and engaging in various games. His initial state of being ignored by other dogs contrasts sharply with his new role.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f9cdc1a1-ff68-4a42-b829-c31ad8a06c48', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s initial state is described as uninteresting and ignored by the other dogs. His transformation into an accepted member requires time; he must show interest, his surroundings before becoming involved in activities with them. Mrs Pumphrey’s intervention through bringing eggs supports him during a crucial phase of recovery.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f324acf9-81cb-4ce6-989c-052ec7b22eb5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s recovery involves no medicinal treatment, only running around with other dogs. He engages in activities like hunting rats at night and joining in games. His newfound acceptance within the pack is marked by his interactions with Joe, a greyhound that leads the pack.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f856232a-1dea-4bb7-affc-2bd6afceba53', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki's initial behavior at the surgery is described as uninteresting and ignored. He becomes part of a group through his interest in his surroundings, becoming active in various activities like rolling over for inspection by Joe. Mrs Pumphrey’s involvement is evident through her frequent visits with fresh eggs.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ccc0b3f6-5eec-4fa3-b292-76c22ae050de', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki is described as having no medicinal treatment other than running with the dogs, yet he shows interest in food and gradually joins their activities. His acceptance within the group includes him joining in games like hunting rats at night. Mrs Pumphrey’s intervention involves bringing fresh eggs to build up his strength.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5959f30c-d7de-4150-91c3-409bd9d220d3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki’s transformation is marked by his growing interest and active participation in activities. He shows interest in surroundings, becoming involved with the pack through various games and hunts. Mrs Pumphrey’s involvement includes bringing fresh eggs to build up strength, which affects her treatment of Tricki.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('58027379-e8e9-47a4-b380-c70d729f2220', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', 'cd50b4f5-3efb-44bb-a0db-a18c9bff356a', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Tricki transforms from being ignored by other dogs at the surgery into an accepted member through his interest in surroundings and engagement with activities. His acceptance within the pack includes him joining games like hunting rats at night, showing signs of fighting for food share. Mrs Pumphrey’s involvement involves bringing fresh eggs to support his recovery.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-660Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
